diff --git a/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..c2089db0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fixed HTTPS proxies used in forwarding mode (``use_forwarding_for_https=True``) to use ``proxy_ssl_context`` for the TLS connection to the proxy instead of ``ssl_context``. Passing ``ssl_context`` in that case is deprecated, emits a ``FutureWarning`` and will raise an error in urllib3 v3.0.
